Easily one of the most popular suits in the entire Iron Legion, "Starboost" features a sleek white, gold, and dark grey color palette. Tony equipped it with heavy thermal shielding, integrated oxygen systems, and a heavy-duty twin-thruster booster pack mounted to its back, allowing the suit to breach the upper atmosphere and maneuver effectively in zero gravity.

In Iron Man 3, Mark XXXIX answers the House Party Protocol call at the Norco oil rig, engaging Extremis forces in aerial combat before being destroyed in the final "Clean Slate" detonation order.
